abstract: >-
  Frozen and reproducible transcriptomic analyses of calcific aortic valve
  disease using GSE51472, GSE12644 and GSE83453. Includes targeted GSEA,
  descriptive Hallmark enrichment, annotated gene sets, current manuscript
  figures, verified source tables, public-data retrieval and reproduction
  records. The release preserves historical files and documents the
  withdrawal of historical NES uncertainty intervals.
keywords:
  - calcific aortic valve disease
  - valvular interstitial cells
  - leptin
  - mTORC1
  - autophagy
  - gene set enrichment analysis
  - reproducible research
